\">得力於全球大型科技公司，去年直接銷售給跨國企業的清潔能源數量激增，創下新高紀錄。歐新社</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">衛報報導，在全球大型科技公司採購推動下，去年直接銷售給跨國企業的清潔能源數量激增，創下新高紀錄。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">過去兩年，由於企業對永續能源的需求增長，他們向再生能源開發商購買的清潔能源，數量已大增兩倍。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">包括谷歌、臉書、亞馬遜和微軟在內的科技巨擘為供電給他們的數據中心，成為再生能源的最大買主。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">彭博新能源（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">BloombergNEF</span>）發現，跨國企業在過去<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>年間購買的清潔能源，超過越南或波蘭等國家的全部能源用量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">根據彭博新能源近日的報告，去年賣給跨國企業的再生能源裡，技科業者占四分之一左右。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">最大買主是谷歌。這家搜尋引擎巨擘使用的綠能將增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40%</span>，取得額外<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1.6GW</span>（百萬瓩）的綠色電力，相等於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">100</span>萬個屋頂太陽能發電量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">彭博新能源發現，去年，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">23</span>個國家的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">100</span>家公司買進<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">19.5GW</span>的再生能源，比前年的紀錄再增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">這些所謂的電力收購協議（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">PPA</span>）的交易金額可能介於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">200</span>億<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">-300</span>億美元之間，約占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年全球綠能投資總額的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">電力收購協議的市場在北美呈現快速增長之勢，那裡是這類交易的主力，但在歐洲和拉丁美洲也逐漸增加。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">光是去年，就有近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">400</span>家公司承諾要設定有實證的氣候目標，設定此目標的公司數量增加超過一倍。<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">63</span>家公司矢言購買足以<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">100%</span>滿足其能源需求的清潔能源。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">這些重視永續發展的承諾可望在未來十年，促成近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1000</span>億美元的清潔能源投資，在全球興建<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">105GW</span>的太陽能或風力發電廠。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://udn.com/news/story/6811/4315212</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-02-03","clk_count":"234"}},"__N_SSG":true}